Visual manifest and failure evidence: `/tmp/actions-pr115-exact-visual/`. Required next step is a bounded writer repair with a real-browser RED regression, then complete Runtime/Canvas rendered receipts, push, hosted CI and independent exact-SHA review. Keep draft; do not merge.

LIVE EXTERNAL-CONDITION REFRESH — 2026-08-16

