No release, publication, tag movement, unsigned fallback, or workflow dispatch occurred. The release lane remains fail-closed on signing configuration.

This does not change #91's independent admission result: SDK primitives exist, but the application-owned verifier/provider/issuer/token/shared-state contract is still absent. Any older wording implying a Runtime GitHub release was observed is superseded by this live refresh.

