- two clean Runtime/Canvas builds were byte-identical with complete file+directory inventories;
- Runtime has no undeclared `assets/` structure; both validators reject rogue directories/symlinks;
- real Chromium rendered visible Runtime and Canvas roots with zero normal console errors, no external JS/CSS tags/requests;
- exact desktop dark/light, 390×844 mobile, loading, API-error and Canvas PNG hashes are recorded in `/tmp/actions-pr115-browser-16da-visual/evidence-manifest.json`.

Static fixture limits remain explicit and do not assert aesthetic or live authenticated action execution acceptance. No tracked mutation occurred.

Fresh Terra/high final review is active. Keep draft; no merge until it accepts this exact SHA.
